<title>GREECE: GREEK CAP MKT COMMISSION PRES TO HOLD PRESSER AT 1430 LOCAL.</title>
<headline>GREEK CAP MKT COMMISSION PRES TO HOLD PRESSER AT 1430 LOCAL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's capital markets commission president Stavros Thomadakis will hold a presser on bourse developments today at 1430 local.</p>
<p>Thomadakis is expected to make recommendations to investors in view of the bourse's sharp rise, national economy ministry sources said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
